Apologies for the code talk here. 
<br />
<br />This mod is just a pre-fix harmony patch for StardewValley.Object.placementAction that are `IsFruitTreeSapling`. 
<br />
<br />Basically there are 2 methods in StardewValley.Object that I say lead to this "bug".
<br />
<br />There is the "canBePlaced" method and the "placementAction" method.
<br />
<br />For fruit tree saplings, the "canBePlaced" method follows these rules.
<br />[code]
<br /> if (IsFruitTreeSapling())
<br />                    {
<br />                        if (objectAtTile != null)
<br />                        {
